sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Người dùng
    participant API as Search API
    participant S as SearchService
    participant PG as PostgreSQL registry và metadata
    participant E as Shared CLIP runtime
    participant Q as Qdrant
    participant M as Private MinIO
    U->>API: Text và image, fusion, weights, K, rerank
    API->>API: Auth, validate multipart/JSON và input bounds
    API->>S: Validated SearchRequest
    S->>PG: Check pinned active generation/model/index
    S->>E: Batch whole-query và supported clauses
    E-->>S: Compatible text vectors
    S->>E: Resource-limited decode và same image tower
    E-->>S: Compatible image vector
    par Text branches trong channel cap
        S->>Q: query_points theo text vectors
        Q-->>S: Native ranks/cosines
    and Image branch
        S->>Q: query_points theo image vector
        Q-->>S: Native ranks/cosines
    end
    S->>S: UUID union, RRF hoặc weighted score, pool cap
    S->>PG: Batch ready receipts, metadata và tags
    PG-->>S: Eligible records và metadata evidence
    S->>S: Required AND/OR gate, UNKNOWN policy
    opt Rerank enabled
        S->>Q: Batch stored vectors, verify digest
        S->>S: Bounded transparent scoring hoặc explicit fallback
    end
    S->>M: HEAD originals cho final candidates
    M-->>S: Object existence/size
    S-->>API: Top-K, score type, contributions và evidence
    API-->>U: Typed response, relative private content URLs
    Note over API,S: Full ASGI duration ghi sau final response send
